# User Data Template Conventions

## Script Header
Always start with `#!/bin/bash` and `set -euxo pipefail`

## AL2023 Package Manager
Use `dnf`, not `yum` -- AL2023 does not ship yum

## Java
Install via `dnf install -y java-17-amazon-corretto-headless`

## JVM Flags
On t3.small (2 GiB RAM): `-Xmx512m -XX:+UseSerialGC`

## S3 Artifact Download
Use a retry loop:
```bash
for i in 1 2 3; do
  aws s3 cp "s3://${artifact_bucket}/${jar_name}" /opt/app/${jar_name} && break || sleep 10
done
```

## Systemd Units
- Each JAR runs as a systemd unit with `Restart=on-failure`
- Environment variables set in the unit file's `Environment=` directives

## Logging
Log completion: `echo "User data complete for <service>" | systemd-cat -t user-data`
